    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "```bash\ndsh plugin --profile web add https://github.com/Modole/dsh-plugin-git-laoboshi.git\n```\n\nRestart `dsh web` after installation. DSH reads the `dsh.bundle` manifest and adds this package to the selected profile."
